      "t": "Chef Victor wants to impress someone with his French friend Jacques. Jacques mumbles in French and tries to kiss Victor. Victor stops him and offers him some food first. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'to give' and 'to try' — you will catch every word right away. See you in the next scene.",
